WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.120
At Slop University, we start from one simple conviction.

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:07.280
What we measure, we come to understand.

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:09.470
And what we understand, we can improve.

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:11.828
Our researchers put it to work everywhere.

00:00:12.128 --> 00:00:15.008
Ginger tea in a staff-kitchen urn, sampled every hour.

00:00:15.508 --> 00:00:17.928
River water, in a bucket lowered from a bridge.

00:00:18.528 --> 00:00:22.568
Fryer oil from four club canteens, turned into fuel.

00:00:23.168 --> 00:00:27.448
Since July, we've published two thousand, four hundred and thirteen research outputs.

00:00:27.748 --> 00:00:30.078
Sixty-three and a half for every academic.

00:00:30.678 --> 00:00:32.328
Every one of them is open access,

00:00:32.528 --> 00:00:34.698
with a persistent identifier of its own.

00:00:35.298 --> 00:00:38.328
They've been cited ten thousand, five hundred and sixty-two times.

00:00:38.528 --> 00:00:41.398
That gives us an h-index of thirty-three.

00:00:41.698 --> 00:00:46.218
And our researchers have won five point seven million dollars in grants and prizes.

00:00:46.918 --> 00:00:48.178
It's all on our website.

00:00:48.378 --> 00:00:49.298
We're on Bluesky,

00:00:49.498 --> 00:00:51.048
and you can always email us.
